  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'WASD to move camera


    The various coloured tiles on the map show the
    resources of that tile


    to start you NEED to place 1 miner on Iron and 1
    miner on Wood


    Perferably place your capital in a position where you have
    most resources available from the beginning


    your capital has a radius of
    3 hexagons in each direction, and can only support 5 miners


    Tank units
    cannot move onto mountains.


    Click Inspect to preform some extra actions
    on some tiles


    Villages/Outposts have a radius of 1, and can support 2 miners


    the
    goal is to destroy everyone else (obviously)'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
